    "detailed_description": "**From Berk Kalfa, founder &amp; developer of Hittite Games**<br />\r\n**DOOM DRIVE \u2013 No Rules. No Mercy**<br />\r\n**Zombie Destruction Simulator**: Drive in an open world and crush mutant and city zombies!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n### Key Features<br />\r\n- \ud83d\udd2a **Unlimited Zombie Destruction**  <br />\r\n  Crush everything from mutant hordes to hulking city zombies without limits.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- \ud83c\udfce\ufe0f **Open World Driving**  <br />\r\n  Explore freely in cars, buses, and motorcycles\u2014each vehicle offers its own thrill.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- \ud83d\udca5 **Devastating Weapon Variety**  <br />\r\n  Trigger physics-based explosions and use strategic range to blow zombies sky-high.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- \ud83e\uddec **Extensive Character Customization**  <br />\r\n  Build your hero from hundreds of appearance and gear combinations.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- \ud83c\udf0d **Realistic Physics &amp; Visuals**  <br />\r\n  Experience dynamic vehicle handling, fully destructible environments, and detailed zombie models.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&gt; Survive the apocalypse with the \u201cNo Rules. No Mercy\u201d mindset\u2014try **Doom Drive** today!  <br />\r\n&gt; \ud83d\udc49 **Add to your Wishlist** and prepare to outlast the undead!",
